  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8364eca21617d862e578fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "实在感激不尽！接下来也要拜托你\\n多多照顾千代……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d016d1de41a2b6d21998e0a6c9f586595649d0223ca01c7ad1c9b70a350f04a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "897"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1f6574858d8b5003e90069",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「今天的樱花是明天的樱饼」，我会将胜利\\n当作动力，继续朝梦想迈进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "482232df8f93b9f3938529b15a86fe97fafc7ab77fc202d293b9cdae58da5c52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "898"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35e9b260d4c253756444195",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵，这简直是场为我而办的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5851c001fa990c48b11208434e858463ac7f3cac444c7a4e8f3ac382847be4df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "899"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e6c1acfb8f7685cccb7fe4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "糟糕，我连获胜时要表演的桥段都还没……\\n哎呀？有东西在你的头上……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b88de523974648e469c0b07fbf6c0f895d67261aa9cf627c41eef0a939b5dc15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ddcb3413bebeff88bd33f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会为大家做饭，也会在早上叫大家起床……\\n用这样的方式来获得活力♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bacd3579933667a6a6922c67b55d57bc2346909f5532864bd7e00b132d9d1de1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3334645f4aa687b5e6464210",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我也可以考虑赏你一个奖励吧。\\n就带你去散步好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56e264dd84779bc50f5752f1df3b66c3a9f1c083ef4b01b75e8e0ab3ad93b124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "900"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310f50a9177d12a776a7dae6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真希望这瞬间的灿烂能成为永恒……\\n我幸福到不禁这么想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27d2292d3f7adacd423e162221062fb8f13f2bd3a81b5627be0f61463a34b65c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "901"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff473cabbb482626af80308d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "由衷地感谢……你愿意相信我的双脚，\\n并带领我抵达这阵光辉之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6562d44dcefb5c5e70b64411b4d57b1d1f530ef2133b787725b483d4bb808fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "902"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21413c510d51c7161206866f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……是不要畏惧去看清自己的本质。\\n我认为那正是迈向真正强悍的一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad223506890776090b7c3892ed3d7ed4dff7d8ef5190a038205423b87340477b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "903"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2a941fa0ed0189d678cdd87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不，我依然还远远不及那种境界。\\n我还想在战斗当中……继续燃烧自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed4b254f41106efaa451c6c3433acb7546390986ffd5b5a4b5034ccf0142835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "904"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f72c4e64acd9aa0646774f77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我由衷地感谢目白家的荣耀，\\n在一路上支持我抵达这座巅峰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dca2a54228550e043b072cc4d4088da392bb649af5e8d8207cf94537c456e3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "907"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0765e34021232ae8e7523f1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就像期盼已久的季节来临了一般，\\n心中感到既愉快又温暖呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "97756e67a60ce6ff0d085a2bfb4faa6e172c4dbe44b7f979b83ec2ba367207f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "908"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb5b93620e3b1d27d355fac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子下次也会以胜者舞台的C位为目标\\n一路领先！要继续支持我喔☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9be7d7ecbf74fe640e58653dcfe35df75f735c9d62bb679667d0b891d646fe2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:417d49b9f46ce209a74f16e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "别输给冬天的寒冷，学着忍耐并储蓄力量。\\n你累积的努力一定可以绽放出花朵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "626f145d18b82919f9c6e858902cb46491bc558b82ed2b010935a957896ddbf8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8014bd80e785f66aecf97277",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这真是超乎预期的快乐结局！\\n不过──我的樱花还不到凋落的时候！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a679713b17cd43fcf491f5596a6f6b4a5c08b8d7c3ead609e617f20b90b7393e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "912"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c88f34e1b2743e9e4c449f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然是多亏了风水啰☆让我写专栏的话，\\n我就能详细解释清楚了说──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dda0e35518345c5b686d3be2bac604493cc8c5e71cead04b0118bf170f07e175",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "918"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935b4ccc4526a12ad5eede55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家帮我加油──！如果有人稍微对风水\\n开始感兴趣，请一定要告诉我喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9287fbd14f643dedb3c21d3f3ee3dfdfeb415ac95136d208f332b73dfd9e4b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "919"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24821c9768d6d86a9545363",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然还是一路领先到底……吧？总之！\\n我会朝着胜者舞台的C位醒目地冲刺☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85a35327dea785cd06ced2e2f7a0f779afe9b440d29f5faf9b789d7278e10fe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ed016ac16b8361f6ea3ef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的吗！？我好开心喔！你也利用风水\\n变幸福吧，我会仔细教你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac91ecd95853ca0d8f4577b4d6a59af32ff6be0110415fbaba6eb57ffacdd3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "920"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c74d5c803ca17d85a85b44",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "工作运势一定会变好！公事包、笔、名片夹，\\n这些我也建议换成新的喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e925061783ef1c134a26d8d638f9fb722d56edfe38b8f400d32deba5e30132f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "921"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b79afaa3e551d08fb39547",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我弟弟妹妹好像都来到现场了♪\\n姐姐很努力喔──！谢谢你们──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f778a61a7e8f54502f132cc76e147999db83a16e669011dc9398d0c5472ef698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "922"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4006bb2c5abe24794055df39",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真的吗！？我好开心喔！你也利用风水\\n变幸福吧，我会仔细教你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ac91ecd95853ca0d8f4577b4d6a59af32ff6be0110415fbaba6eb57ffacdd3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "923"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12a74cd5ed583a4817d62df2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "工作运势一定会变好！公事包、笔、名片夹，\\n这些我也建议换成新的喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e925061783ef1c134a26d8d638f9fb722d56edfe38b8f400d32deba5e30132f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "924"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d37f46f4a732450a9189bacf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我弟弟妹妹好像都来到现场了♪\\n姐姐很努力喔──！谢谢你们──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f778a61a7e8f54502f132cc76e147999db83a16e669011dc9398d0c5472ef698",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "925"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1095839d42460aa5f84415",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿！但也是因为实力增强了才能优胜的，\\n所以也是训练员的功劳喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d8d3f1e386192f9e4dd9e01a324553220c4b221401eb49d83bcdfb8cc5c996",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "926"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02e153f7f187ee0af9cff860",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场胜利是多亏了风水才赢得的……\\n能让大家明白这件事的话我会很开心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d06683781a4c8086a014c219443ab84c2c14c5e6540c5c24378ecb85e3b76b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "927"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7e50a43ff293079cf04c988",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿！但也是因为实力增强了才能优胜的，\\n所以也是训练员的功劳喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "61d8d3f1e386192f9e4dd9e01a324553220c4b221401eb49d83bcdfb8cc5c996",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "928"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43eb75da1c20f804303fe4b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这场胜利是多亏了风水才赢得的……\\n能让大家明白这件事的话我会很开心的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1d06683781a4c8086a014c219443ab84c2c14c5e6540c5c24378ecb85e3b76b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "929"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d7c7eb7420e4541f953f636",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是、是！我应该有做到冷静跑完──啊！\\n唔唔，抱歉……我还不太习惯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b425262b4df0e14460471b0bb3aee20b230b4269f6d83b436c8252bd764206ed",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818d0de16fdd1011705228f6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Thank you，ありがとう，merci。\\n我用各种语言表达我的感谢啰。嗯哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c887d3db24e2cef61ac48266dda30073de77676a1e06a9c886cfbcd56853ad6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "930"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d8352974c615ce96396496",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把愿望都注入在小真娃娃上了。成效就是\\n大家看到的这样。你家要不要也摆一个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "309c991aefd2d76f49fc6bf3174cfb62b4a09dc3629dee6481ba1fae2e19c112",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:258a685cd7bdfe8f0880e9b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会把晨间练跑的时间提早一点点。\\n如果看到睡眼惺忪的小真，要叫醒我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0919e150fa45cda1f424f4575e54c78cfd2f6f1d3976002659abb9932716a032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "932"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:232c6306a3bb83641a55077a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～♪这真是令人开心呢。\\n可以再更～目不转睛地看着我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16382fda4e5566d39191cfafa8cd0e7c669f69d1c6da08c135a22debe35b6da7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "933"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb40cb2b5d2c0129d7a44261",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家都有好好看着小真吗？\\n除了眨眼以外，都不能移开目光喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f363b58d6d3bc18052a9d97728ffb1460d281f105474bce8b060d9a4a29a65b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "934"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48b0247576f227723c74e0f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会把晨间练跑的时间提早一点点。\\n如果看到睡眼惺忪的小真，要叫醒我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0919e150fa45cda1f424f4575e54c78cfd2f6f1d3976002659abb9932716a032",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "935"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5584e89935ede176ffaa5eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～♪这真是令人开心呢。\\n可以再更～目不转睛地看着我喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16382fda4e5566d39191cfafa8cd0e7c669f69d1c6da08c135a22debe35b6da7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "936"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c80b0739a7ae27624824ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家都有好好看着小真吗？\\n除了眨眼以外，都不能移开目光喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f363b58d6d3bc18052a9d97728ffb1460d281f105474bce8b060d9a4a29a65b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "937"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c02346d73d3145e9bf691079",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能设立一个光滑的小真雕像。\\n欢迎大家都来可以「摸摸头」的旅游景点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c64eb55d9738901a16107ef11291ea37c62deb08d61dd12fdadc25f0d3f547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "938"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e5a025f4015be8b863ab2c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是妈妈。但她应该还没看才对。\\n所以在她打电话来之前都要「嘘～」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "318eb1416d0177f113cf59d5b48fb4ecd559123786fc3eb2d4b28cabf778d63e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "939"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89f4d34f6f7777cabf38c90e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我、我想想喔……我喜欢的作者要出新书了，\\n我打算去买那本和一些旧书，还有──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b02390b57e7ac68908fd7c5c08911694fdddad6ae1e6946032e292d8567a180c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d436d3ff24430c231498cc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "希望能设立一个光滑的小真雕像。\\n欢迎大家都来可以「摸摸头」的旅游景点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c64eb55d9738901a16107ef11291ea37c62deb08d61dd12fdadc25f0d3f547",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "940"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:736374aff37167c1fa946f1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是妈妈。但她应该还没看才对。\\n所以在她打电话来之前都要「嘘～」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "318eb1416d0177f113cf59d5b48fb4ecd559123786fc3eb2d4b28cabf778d63e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e727c4ba38255b207faac786",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "圆滚滚跟绿豆，还有乱蓬蓬……\\n啊，它们是我在森林里的好朋友。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb31ca498d1b0d99d58ee5d6571dcdf6ec8286944e79427c81de639f02a1bbe9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "942"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69dff78c8ddeb97b9193dda2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想应该有成为飓风吧……呵呵，但因为\\n风是无法掌握的，所以也很难分享感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70c8244c4d54edeb51f4329d3cb6ba2e202c1f230f3592e077db0be60e153d5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "943"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeaa38e389cb3db931595514",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "集中精神……？啊，我当时其实是在感受\\n和煦的风，不过好像也可以这样解读没错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a848396c98a7277c2b036324bc7d307b7f8ec531ee827b9ae4757bddb748103",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "944"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:775c9b7c027c78b260f5b781",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这里是最能感受到凉风的地方。\\n同时，还能听清楚随风而来的欢呼声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f45515a3803156e2b073ca547f318cab423ef4aa6afc6e99be080f55ee2cc0a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "945"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94dd092d530aa09a30bc6972",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当然很开心。\\n就像是被风筝到空中漂浮的感觉喔。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "149e825a13e8d886c85955028bdeb215729257ae058631d7d271bb73a77a0266",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
